<title>ARGENTINA: Astra and YPF buy 67 pct of Mexpetrol Argentina.</title>
<headline>Astra and YPF buy 67 pct of Mexpetrol Argentina.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine oil firm ASTRA CAPSA said Monday it and YPF SA bought a 67 percent stake in Mexpetrol Argentina for $204 million.</p>
<p>Each paid $102 million, ASTRA told the Buenos Aires Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>With the new deal ASTRA, which already had a 33 percent in Mexpetrol Argentina, raised its stake in it to 66.5 percent, while the remaining 33.5 percent is now held by YPF.</p>
<p>ASTRA is controlled by Spain's Repsol.</p>
<p>((--Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-065000</p>
